DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260706T073000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
SUMMARY:Gym — apartment\, before Ahana wakes
DESCRIPTION:Default routine (swap or skip anything that aggravates your bac
 k — this is a template\, not a prescription\; the PT evaluation can adju
 st it once scheduled):\n1. 5 min brisk walk warm-up\n2 rounds of: 10 glute
  bridges\, 8 bird-dogs per side\, 10 bodyweight hip hinges (light dumbbell
 s if you have them)\n5 min walk or gentle stretch to close\nNothing spine-
 flexing (no sit-ups/crunches) until PT clears it. 20-30 min total. Month-o
 ne goal is showing up\, not intensity. Moved to mornings because nothing n
 on-work fits inside your working hours — finish showered before Ahana wa
 kes at 8:00.
END:VEVENT
