DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260713T123500
RRULE:INTERVAL=2;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH
SUMMARY:Lunch + midday BP pill — Bowl B (quinoa + chickpea)
DESCRIPTION:THIS WEEK'S BOWL: 1 cup cooked quinoa + 3/4 cup roasted chickpe
 as (toss canned chickpeas\, patted dry\, with 1 tsp oil + 1/2 tsp cumin + 
 salt\, air fryer 400F 12 min on Sunday) + 1/2 cup roasted vegetable + 2 tb
 sp yogurt + a spoon of pickle. Microwave quinoa 60 sec\, plate\, add the r
 est cold. 3 minutes total.\n\nTake the midday BP pill from the kitchen-tab
 le organizer WITH the food — non-negotiable\, skip the rest of the day b
 efore you skip this.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
