DESCRIPTION:No new bowl today — eat whatever's left in the containers\, o
 r a fallback: toast + peanut butter\, or 2 fried eggs + toast. No decision
  needed\, no cooking needed.\n\nTake the midday BP pill from the kitchen-t
 able organizer WITH the food — non-negotiable.
END:VEVENT
